<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="legal">
    <h1>Delivery &amp; Activation</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated: 19 October 2026</strong></p>
    <p><%= settings.siteName %> is a digital service. Nothing is posted or couriered to you, and there are no delivery or shipping charges.</p>

    <h2>What you are buying</h2>
    <p>A prepaid software subscription for the <%= settings.siteName %> Android app: a fixed number of days on one mobile number. There is no auto-renewal and no saved card. A plan simply ends when its days run out.</p>

    <h2>How it reaches you</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The plan is attached to the <strong>mobile number you enter when you pay</strong>, so use the number you signed in to the app with.</li>
      <li><strong>Online payment through UPI:</strong> your plan starts within about a minute of the payment being confirmed.</li>
      <li><strong>Direct UPI to our account, from the order page:</strong> your plan starts within a few minutes once the payment matches our bank record; if it has to be checked by hand, the same day.</li>
      <li>The app picks up a new plan on its own within a minute, and the Status screen shows the new expiry date.</li>
      <li>Nothing has to be installed again, and no key or code is sent to you. The plan is attached to your number, not to a file.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where it works</h2>
    <p>India, on one Android phone per plan. Using the same plan on a second phone needs account authorization.</p>

    <h2>If your plan does not activate</h2>
    <p>Write to us with your mobile number and the payment reference — the order number or the UPI transaction ID. Our contact details are on the Contact page, and we reply within 2 working days.</p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>Cancellation and refunds are covered by our <a href="/refunds">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>Support hours:</strong> <%= settings.supportHours %></p>

    <h2>Who runs <%= settings.siteName %></h2>
    <p><%= settings.siteName %> is owned and operated by its founder, <strong><%= settings.ownerName %></strong>.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contactEmail %>"><%= settings.contactEmail %></a></li>
      <li>Address: <%= settings.officeAddress %></li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Grievance officer</h3>
    <p><strong><%= settings.grievanceOfficer %></strong> — <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contactEmail %>"><%= settings.contactEmail %></a>.<br>
    Complaints about the app or about your data are acknowledged within 24 hours and resolved within 15 days.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
